Package: bbka.analytics
Type: Package
Title: BBKA Analytics Studio: Advanced Educational & Social Science Statistical Suite
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Kartianom", "Kartianom", email = "kartianom@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: BBKA Analytics Studio is an integrated statistical analysis and research reporting suite tailored for large-scale educational assessments (PISA, TIMSS, Asesmen Nasional) and social science research. It features an ultra-modern reactive Next.js web application powered by an R native plumber computational engine, supporting t-Test, ANOVA, ANCOVA, MANOVA, Hierarchical Regression, Structural Equation Modeling / Path Analysis (lavaan), Multilevel Modeling (lme4), and Two-Stage IPD Meta-Analysis (metafor).
